# Deprecated historical snapshot

This filename is retained only so existing links do not break.

Do not install or execute this file as the active skill. The original snapshot mixed multiple repository files into one document and contained write-enabled example values that no longer meet the repository's security posture.

Use these current files instead:

- `SKILL.md` — active execution instructions
- `config.example.yaml` — safe public example with the destination disabled and report-only mode
- `SECURITY.md` — threat model and operational controls
- `README.md` — user-facing setup and capability boundaries

The original snapshot remains available through Git history for maintainers who need an audit trail. It must not be copied into an active skill directory or used as a configuration source.
